<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόγ-εος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bright as fire,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.745
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				8.389
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>burning, flaming,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὸς αὐγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1104
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογέας δαλοῖσι χέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1257
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					340
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>inflamed, red,</i>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόγεαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθραί</span>
			, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.152
			</span></i>; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόγιος.</span>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
